ta/snapshot.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T02:20:36+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/acl-support-in-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/acl-support-in-sonic/", "title": "ACL \u306e\u57fa\u672c\u8a2d\u8a08\uff08ACL_TABLE / ACL_RULE \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\uff09", "content_html": "ACL \u306e\u57fa\u672c\u8a2d\u8a08\uff08ACL_TABLE / ACL_RULE \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e data plane ACL \u306e \u521d\u671f\u8a2d\u8a08 \u3092\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3059\u308b\u6587\u66f8\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/acl-support-in-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T14:21:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-port-auto-negotiation-design/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-port-auto-negotiation-design/", "title": "\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8 Auto-Negotiation\uff08advertised-speeds / interface-type\uff09", "content_html": "\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8 Auto-Negotiation\uff08advertised-speeds / interface-type\uff09 \u2014 IEEE 802.3 \u306e auto-negotiation \u306f\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u306e\u4e21\u7aef\u3067 \u8907\u6570\u306e speed / interface type \u3092\u540c\u6642\u306b\u63d0\u793a \u3057\u3001\u30cd\u30b4\u3067\u6700\u826f\u306e\u7d44\u5408\u305b\u3092\u9078\u3076\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-port-auto-negotiation-design.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T00:03:07+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/", "title": "\u8a55\u4fa1\u8005\u5411\u3051\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9", "content_html": "\u30e9\u30dc\u3067 SONiC \u3092\u8a66\u7528\u3059\u308b\u8aad\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306b\u3001\u4eee\u60f3\u74b0\u5883\u307e\u305f\u306f\u8a55\u4fa1\u6a5f\u3067\u8d77\u52d5\u3057\u3001\u7ba1\u7406 IP\u3001\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3001VLAN\u3001BGP \u306a\u3069\u306e\u57fa\u672c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u5165\u308c\u3066\u72b6\u614b\u78ba\u8a8d\u307e\u3067\u8fbf\u308b\u5c0e\u7dda\u3068\u3001\u6700\u5c0f bring-up \u4f8b\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/evaluator.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T06:46:22+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/vxlan-sonic/", "title": "VXLAN / VNet \u5168\u4f53\u8a2d\u8a08\uff08VxlanOrch / VnetOrch / VRF mapper\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC \u306e VXLAN / VNet \u5168\u4f53\u8a2d\u8a08\u306e\u30cf\u30d6\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3002VTEP\uff08VXLAN Tunnel End Point\uff09\u3068 VNet\uff08Virtual Network\uff09\u306e\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3067\u5b9f\u88c5\u3055\u308c\u3001Phase 1 \u3067\u306f VM\u2194\u30d9\u30a2\u30e1\u30bf\u30eb\u9593\u306e VNet \u30d4\u30a2\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u3068 Symmetric IRB\u3001Phase 2 \u3067\u306f BGP EVPN \u7d71\u5408\u30fbL2 VXLAN\u30fbHER \u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002\u6982\u5ff5\u30fb\u8a2d\u5b9a/\u904b\u7528\u30fb\u5185\u90e8\u5b9f\u88c5\u30fb\u5236\u9650\u306e\u6d3e\u751f 4 \u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3078\u306e\u5c0e\u7dda\u3092\u793a\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/overlay/vxlan-sonic.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T15:08:57+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-cache/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-cache/", "title": "APPL_STATE_DB ROUTE_TABLE (route offload cache)", "content_html": "APPL_STATE_DB ROUTE_TABLE \u2014 RouteOrch \u304c SAI \u7d4c\u8def\u30d7\u30ed\u30b0\u30e9\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u6210\u529f\u5f8c\u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080\u7d4c\u8def\u30aa\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u30ad\u30e3\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3002SAI \u5931\u6557\u6642\u306e\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f\u30b9\u30ad\u30c3\u30d7\u30fbDEL \u5931\u6557\u6642\u306e\u6b8b\u7559\u30fbfpmsyncd \u306e offload \u901a\u77e5\u5236\u5fa1\u30fb\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u5b9a\u6570\u30fbfpmsyncd/route_check.py \u3078\u306e\u526f\u4f5c\u7528\u9023\u9396\u30fbResponsePublisher/NotificationConsumer \u901a\u4fe1\u30e1\u30ab\u30cb\u30ba\u30e0\u30fbMellanox ECMP \u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u6570\u88dc\u6b63\u30fbVOQ ECMP \u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u30fc\u6570\u5236\u9650\u3092\u542b\u3080\u5206\u6790\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/route-cache.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:21:12+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/link-flapping/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/link-flapping/", "title": "T0/T1 \u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u304c flap \u3057\u7d9a\u3051\u308b", "content_html": "T0/T1 \u9593\u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u304c\u983b\u7e41\u306b up/down \u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051 runbook\u3002flap \u983b\u5ea6\u306e\u5b9a\u91cf\u5316\u3001DOM \u5024\u3068\u30d9\u30f3\u30c0\u30fc\u5225 threshold \u306e\u78ba\u8a8d\u3001FEC / autoneg / \u7269\u7406\u5c64\u306e\u9806\u3067\u539f\u56e0\u3092\u8ffd\u3044\u8fbc\u3080\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/link-flapping.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:51:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-mgmt_vrf/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-mgmt_vrf/", "title": "sonic-mgmt_vrf YANG", "content_html": "sonic-mgmt_vrf YANG \u2014 \u30de\u30cd\u30b8\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8 VRF (mgmt traffic \u3092 data-plane \u3068\u5206\u96e2\u3059\u308b VRF) \u306e\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u6709\u52b9/\u7121\u52b9\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b YANG \u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-mgmt_vrf.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:00:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-spanning-tree/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-spanning-tree/", "title": "sonic-spanning-tree YANG", "content_html": "sonic-spanning-tree YANG \u2014 PVST / MSTP \u306e\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u30fbVLAN \u5225\u30fb\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u5225\u30fbMST instance/port \u5225\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-spanning-tree.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:06:13+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-internals/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-internals/", "title": "Switchport \u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3068 VLAN CLI \u62e1\u5f35 \u2014 \u5185\u90e8\u5b9f\u88c5", "content_html": "Switchport \u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306e YANG / CONFIG_DB \u30b9\u30ad\u30fc\u30de\u3068 db_migrator \u62e1\u5f35\u306e\u4e2d\u8eab\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u6d3e\u751f\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/switch-port-modes-and-vlan-cli-internals.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T06:14:50+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-12T01:03:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-pmon-sensor-monitoring-enhancement/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-pmon-sensor-monitoring-enhancement/", "title": "SensorMon\uff08PMON \u5185\u306e voltage / current \u30bb\u30f3\u30b5\u76e3\u8996\uff09", "content_html": "SensorMon\uff08PMON \u5185\u306e voltage / current \u30bb\u30f3\u30b5\u76e3\u8996\uff09 \u2014 \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u4e0a\u306e\u96fb\u5727\u30fb\u96fb\u6d41\u30fb\u9ad8\u5ea6\u30bb\u30f3\u30b5\u7b49\u3092 hwmon \u7d